  "gradeRuleDescribe": {
    "yms_year": 114.0,
    "yms_smester": 1.0,
    "cls_id": "CB08131",
    "sub_id": "28300",
    "scr_dup": "001",
    "tpa_score_new": "<div>1. 當期中考試或期末考試缺考時，可以進行補考，但得需事先請假或有正當理由，否則補考時候最高分以60分為上限。</div>\n\n<div>2. 點名成績會做為學期分數之調整參考用。</div>\n\n<div>3. 考試作弊或是書面報告抄襲一律以零分計算。</div>\n",
    "tpa_score_new_en": "<div>1. I give make-up test for the students having either the justification or the written request for the absence of&nbsp;midterm or final exam. If the students do not have the reasonable&nbsp;justification&nbsp;for the absence, the maximum score of the make-up test is 60.</div>\n\n<div>2. Class attendance will be taken into consideration for the bonus.</div>\n\n<div>3. The students get failed&nbsp;if any cheating behavior or&nbsp;plagiarism occurs in the course.</div>\n",
    "course_pol": "1. 學生準時到課，並全程參與課程。\n2. 期望學生上課能動手做筆記，將老師板書內容做整理與記錄，方便課後自行學習。\n3. 我會透過課堂小測驗做點名，做為期末加分之參考。",
    "course_pol_en": "Students are expected to attend all lectures. I will also encourage you to take your own lecture notes in class, and that will be helpful on your self-learning. Notice that I will take attendance almost every class. The amount of the extra bonus that I give to students depends on the attendance record.",
    "course_rem": "1. 請隨時注意放置在iLearn平台上，老師自製之課程大綱內容或是考師資訊，以便掌握學期授課與考試進度。\n2. 期望學生課前能先預習老師事先上傳之講義。\n3. 提醒學生要出席實習課程，助教會提供許多練習題，而那些題目或多或少會出現在期中考或期末考試中。",
    "course_rem_en": null,
    "ais_meno": "<div>在撰寫計量軟體操作之技術報告中，請注意下面幾點:</div>\n\n<div>1. 資料來源需清楚說明，且不能使用造假資料。</div>\n\n<div>2. 禁止複製他組文字內容或是製作圖片於報告中。</div>\n\n<div>3. 相關文獻引用需適當。</div>\n",
    "ais_meno_en": "<div>Please following the several points when you write the technical report on the operation of econometrics software:</div>\n\n<div>1. Please describe the data source clearly and do not use the fabricated data in the empirical analysis.</div>\n\n<div>2. Please do not copy-and-paste any&nbsp;content or the figure written by someone else.</div>\n\n<div>3. Please cite the related studies appropriately.</div>\n",
    "ilearn_mk": null
  },
